stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Stopped
    Stopped --> Starting: Operator starts monitoring
    Starting --> Monitoring: Camera opens and detector is ready
    Starting --> Degraded: Camera opens but detector is unavailable
    Starting --> Failed: Camera cannot open or OpenCV is unavailable
    Monitoring --> Monitoring: Frame processed and published
    Monitoring --> Degraded: Detector error, video continues
    Monitoring --> Stopping: Operator stops monitoring
    Monitoring --> Failed: Camera stops returning frames
    Degraded --> Degraded: Raw frames continue streaming
    Degraded --> Stopping: Operator stops monitoring
    Degraded --> Failed: Camera stops returning frames
    Stopping --> Stopped: Camera resource released
    Stopped --> [*]: Application shuts down
    Failed --> [*]